  "title": "The Saturday Selection, Vol. 130",
  "summary": "Stadium chants, stained masterpieces, decoy deals, and so much more.",
  "content": "<p><em>Every day, WITI’s group chats buzz with fresh links. As part of our Saturday send for paid readers, we round up 11 of the best.</em></p><p><em>It’s WITI, on the weekend</em><strong>.</strong></p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NKy7!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08018d84-ac90-414b-b5bb-e72126cfc7d2_1024x768.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NKy7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F08018d84-ac90-414b-b5bb-e72126cfc7d2_1024x768.jpeg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" alt=\"rock&#x27;n&#x27;roll – Lex\" title=\"rock&#x27;n&#x27;roll – Lex\"><div><div></div></div></div></a><figcaption>Jerry Lee Lewis, Carl Perkins, Elvis Presley, and Johnny Cash. 1956!</figcaption></figure></div><p><strong>Why are these interesting?</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://earcandyupdate.substack.com/p/drive-by-truckers-carl-perkins-cadillac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The True Story Behind </a><em><a href=\"https://earcandyupdate.substack.com/p/drive-by-truckers-carl-perkins-cadillac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Carl Perkins’ Cadillac</a></em> (<em>Ear Candy Update</em>)</p><p>Inspired by a <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mJgdrkwGfHw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Drive-By Truckers song</a> I’ve been unable to stop listening to this week.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.beautifulgame.co/why-do-football-fans-turn-pop-songs-into-terrace-chants/?srsltid=AYCX9vKR6Zojsbt1pmNHp0VlkyXbnsuEboowTaJJmrDZ3bXmguIuPohx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Why Do Soccer Fans Turn Pop Songs into Terrace Chats?</a> (<em>Beautiful Game</em>)</p><p>Plus, some of the <a href=\"https://thestrangebrew.co.uk/football-anthems/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">best known ones.</a> And also, a nice tradition I learned about recently: German fans sing ‘Country Roads’ by John Denver <a href=\"https://www.foxsports.com/articles/nfl/from-oktoberfest-to-the-nfl-how-munich-crowd-made-country-roads-a-stadium-ritual\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">whenever the NFL plays in Munich.</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/business/us-steel-nippon-takeover-japan.html?unlocked_article_code=1.RVE.q4yB.0lT3y52QHjZg&amp;smid=nytcore-ios-share\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Japan Attempts to Revive an American Industrial Icon</a> (<em>NYT</em>)</p><p>After its fraught takeover of steel maker U.S. Steel, a Japanese manufacturer is attempting to revitalize the American company’s facilities, including its oldest mill outside Pittsburgh.</p><p><a href=\"https://groundworkcollaborative.org/news/amazons-decoy-deals-groundwork-investigation-reveals-nearly-1-in-3-black-friday-and-cyber-monday-deals-advertised-by-amazon-offered-no-savings-to-shoppers-nearly-1-in-10-w/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Amazon’s Decoy Deals</a> (<em>Groundwork Collaborative</em>)</p><p>An investigation reveals nearly 1 in 3 Black Friday and Cyber Monday “deals” advertised by Amazon offered no savings to shoppers.</p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://whyisthisinteresting.substack.com/p/the-saturday-selection-vol-130\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>",
